msgctxt "240"
msgid "Done yet?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "252"
msgid "We're sorry... We got confused again..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "264"
msgid ""
"Oh, and... this is the money we took from you earlier.\r\n"
"Plus interest..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "276"
msgid "You got <Color:8>1,100,000 yen<Color:Default>."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "288"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "300"
msgid "Well then... If you'll excuse us..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "312"
msgid ""
"Aniki, this is <Italic>not</Italic> right! We can't just let him do this to "
"us!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "324"
msgid "Dude, shut the hell up before you piss the nice gentleman off..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "336"
msgid "I can't believe this! So that's it?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "348"
msgid "Something wrong?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "360"
msgid "Nope, not a thing! Hehe... Hahaha!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "432"
msgid "You got 3,000 EXP."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "444"
msgid "Done yet?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "456"
msgid "We're sorry... We got confused again..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "468"
msgid "Hey! I think gettin' punched helped fix my leg!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "480"
msgid ""
"Really!? Did you hear that, mister? You fixed his leg! Here, I hope this "
"covers your trouble..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "492"
msgid "You got <Color:8>50,000 yen<Color:Default>."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "504"
msgid ""
"Aniki, this is <Italic>not</Italic> right! We can't just let him do this to "
"us!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "516"
msgid "Dude, shut the hell up before you piss the nice gentleman off..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "528"
msgid "I can't believe this! So that's it? Ugh, this is so lame!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "540"
msgid "Something wrong?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "552"
msgid "Nope, not a thing! Hehe... Hahaha...!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "624"
msgid "You got 3,000 EXP."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "648"
msgid "Aaauuugh! Ooowww...!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "672"
msgid "Hey! Where do you think you're goin'!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "684"
msgid "Yo, Pops! Look what you did!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "696"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "708"
msgid ""
"This smartass thinks we're gonna let him fuck\r\n"
"around with us!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "720"
msgid "Heh, you guys are in a good mood."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "744"
msgid ""
"Hey, if it isn't that guy from last time! Still runnin' around knockin' "
"into people? A measly 10 grand's not gonna cut it this time!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "768"
msgid ""
"Why, if it isn't our old friend! We might've let you off easy before, but "
"no such luck this time, asswipe!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "780"
msgid "Aw man, Aniki's hurt bad! The fuck are you gonna do about this?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "792"
msgid "Are you all right!? Don't worry, we got you. Just tell us where it hurts!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "804"
msgid "Ugh... I broke my leg! I can't walk!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "816"
msgid "Looks like a compound fracture.  Aniki might not make it, guys!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "828"
msgid "How are you gonna fix this, asshole!? Start talking!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "840"
msgid "You tell me. What do you want?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "852"
msgid ""
"For starters, how 'bout a hundred thousand⑬no, a million yen⑬for "
"compensation!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "864"
msgid ""
"You got a problem with that? Aniki here is a world-class athlete! That was "
"his golden leg, worth a hot mil!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "876"
msgid ""
"Think you can take on this many of us? You better pay up if you know what's "
"good for ya!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "888"
msgid "A million yen..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "900"
msgid "Why should I give you anything? He isn't even hurt."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "912"
msgid "Heheh, you got balls standin' up to a group of muscleheads, old man."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "924"
msgid "I think it's time you take a little swim in the Okinawan sea!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "948"
msgid "That's it? Here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "960"
msgid "You handed over <Color:8>1,000,000 yen<Color:Default>."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "972"
msgid "Whoa, what the shit? You're just... givin' it to us?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "984"
msgid "Holy shitballs, Aniki! I've never seen that much cash before!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "996"
msgid "Hey, this is great, bro! Now you can pay back your loans!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1008"
msgid ""
"...You know what? I think he's got more. Beat him up and take everything "
"he's got!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1020"
msgid "Huh. Pretty energetic for a guy who just broke his leg."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1032"
msgid ""
"Clam it! You know what we do to small fry like you? We feed them to the "
"sharks in the Okinawan sea. You're fish food, asshole!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1044"
msgid "I just have to pay, right? Here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1056"
msgid "Whoa, what the shit? You're just... givin' it to us?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1068"
msgid "Oops... Looks like I'm short on cash."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1080"
msgid ""
"Hey, now you're just fuckin' with us! And here I was, all happy when you "
"said you'd pay!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1092"
msgid ""
"You can't toy with a dude's heart like that! We're gonna send you to the "
"bottom of the Okinawan sea. You'll be sleeping with the fishes!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1116"
msgid "I'll give you 100,000 yen. Now, leave me alone."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1128"
msgid ""
"A hundred thousand? I'm pretty sure Aniki here said a "
"<Italic>million</Italic>. You goin' deaf, ya dusty old bitch?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1140"
msgid "You think that chump change will fix Aniki's leg!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1152"
msgid "Then what do you want?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1164"
msgid "Keep your fuckin' milk money. There's only one way to solve this!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1188"
msgid "Wait! Guys, come here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1260"
msgid "(Look, guys... I dunno about this...)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1272"
msgid "(What the... Are you serious, Aniki?)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1284"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1356"
msgid "Okay, we made a decision!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1368"
msgid "We're gonna let you off the hook for 100,000 this time!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1380"
msgid "Now, hand it over. And consider yourself lucky!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1392"
msgid "Here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1404"
msgid "You handed over <Color:8>100,000 yen<Color:Default>."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1416"
